  m_Name: TheChariotCard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Card
  name: The Chariot
  text: "The card hums with steady, unyielding energy, the wheels of destiny ready
    to roll forward.  $Its power is controlled, disciplined, yet charged with hidden
    desire.  $You sense the Garde\u2019s heart within it\u2014loyal, steadfast, and
    bound by duty, yet driven by a love he cannot openly show.  $His eyes, fixed
    on the princess beneath the balcony, betray the truth of his devotion.  $The
    Chariot carries him forward, and now, through you, his secret may finally find
    its course."
  sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 38ff51468812948ab925e10c160528ff, type: 3}
